                "text": "Another great year speaking at CTeL\u2019s fall summit! Even before the pandemic, Mississippi has felt the importance of telehealth, especially to our rural areas. I look forward to continuing to work on ways to move telehealth into a more permanent place in our healthcare systems! https://t.co/EsgnbLFVWi",
