                "text": "63% of older adults who are overweight have an interest in taking prescription meds for weight management & 76% think Medicare should cover prescriptions for weight management. The 'Treat and Reduce Obesity Act' would do just that. Check out this poll: https://t.co/ZkgqS2pZj1",
