                "text": "Great to meet with the American Organization for Nursing Leadership! One key topic was my legislation \u2013 the SAVE Healthcare Workers Act \u2013 which aims to strengthen protections for healthcare professionals by increasing penalties for acts of violence against them. These dedicated workers provide critical care to Mississippians and Americans every single day, and they deserve our support and protection.",
