                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Since Risk Rating 2.0 took effect under Biden, flood insurance premiums have spiked nationwide. The system lacks transparency, making it harder to plan, lend, or appeal unfair hikes. I joined my colleagues in calling for its end \u2013 before more Mississippi families and small businesses are forced to drop coverage.\n\nRead the letter here - https://t.co/btFvg5oAdk",
